[0.05, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\n\n\n\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[31A\u001b[37m\u25cb\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 1m 7s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(Initial configuration of the Antigravity agent by `agy_genui_demo` requires inspection within...)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m\u25cf\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m 2 commands \u001b[37m(ls -la && find . -maxdepth 3 -not -path '*/.*' \u00b7 find lib test -type f)\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\u001b[87D\u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 7 files \u001b[37m(README.md, pubspec.yaml, main.dart, +4)\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\u001b[57D\u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m \u001b[37m(find /Users/brett/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/antigravity-0.18.1/lib -type f)\u001b[m\n\u001b[80D\u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 13 files \u001b[37m(chat_screen.dart, top_toolbar.dart, thread_sidebar.dart, +10)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[1m### Initial Working Directory of the Antigravity \u001b[94mlocalharness\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  In this program, the initial working directory of \u001b[94mlocalharness\u001b[m (both its OS process working directory and its\r\n  configured Antigravity workspace directory) defaults to \u001b[94mDirectory.current.absolute.path\u001b[39;1m of the parent Flutter macOS\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1mprocess\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  Here is the exact chain of how it is resolved"]
