[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[29A\u2022 \u001b[1mLaunched via CLI (\u001b[94;22mflutter run -d macos\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: \u001b[94mDirectory.current.absolute.path\u001b[m is the shell directory where \u001b[94mflutter run\u001b[m\r\n  was invoked (e.g., \u001b[94m/Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n  \u2022 \u001b[1mLaunched from Finder / Dock / \u001b[94;22mopen\u001b[39;1m (\u001b[94;22magy_genui_demo.app\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: macOS \u001b[94mlaunchd\u001b[m sets the process working directory of GUI\r\n  app bundles to \u001b[94m/\u001b[m (the root directory), unless changed or overridden.\u001b[K\r\n  \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[1m### Program Review\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[1m#### Strengths\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u2022 \u001b[1mClean Layered Architecture\u001b[m: Clear separation between domain models (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk81ffdeb99ebe7d65;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/domain/models/chat_models.dart\u0007chat_models.dart\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007), data/SDK session\r\n  management (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk2059f1a6f80ea59a;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart\u0007chat_repository.dart\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007), state management (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk119307668daea0f5;file:/"]
[0.0, "o", "//Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart\u0007chat_view_model.dart\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007), and UI widgets.\u001b[K\r\n  \u2022 \u001b[1mPer-Thread Stream & Lifecycle Isolation\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkf0515b12ed84bca5;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/view_models/chat_view_model.dart#L143-L229\u0007ChatViewModel.sendMessage\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 tracks \u001b[94m_activeRequestIds\u001b[m and\r\n  \u001b[94m_replySubscriptions\u001b[m per \u001b[94mthreadId\u001b[m, allowing background threads to continue streaming while the user switches threads,\r\n  and cleanly stops the \u001b[94mlocalharness\u001b[m process via \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk7b79ff602a56a740;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L192-L197\u0007ChatRepository.closeThreadSession\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 when a thread is deleted.\u001b[K\r\n  \u2022 \u001b[1mDesktop UX Details\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkaa5cd7d51704e094;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/ui/features/chat/views/widgets/markdown_composer.dart#L38-L69\u0007MarkdownComposer\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 properly guards \u001b[94mEnter\u001b[m-to-s"]
[0.0, "o", "end against active macOS IME composition\u001b[K\r\n  (\u001b[94m_isImeComposing\u001b[m) and supports \u001b[94mShift + Enter\u001b[m for newlines.\u001b[K\r\n  \u2022 \u001b[1mTestability\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk2d9ce65785cfe51d;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L9-L18\u0007AntigravityAgentSession\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk855cbea6205861e;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L63-L67\u0007AntigravitySessionBuilder\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 allow \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk35d37012567a213a;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/test/widget_test.dart\u0007widget_test.dart\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 to test streaming,\r\n  error formatting, and session teardown deterministically without spawning real \u001b[94mlocalharness\u001b[m processes.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[1m#### Potential Issues & Observations\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  1. \u001b[1mImplicit \u001b[94;22mDirectory.current\u001b[39;1m Workspace in Release \u001b[94;22m.app\u001b[39;1m Builds\u001b[m\r\n      \u2022 Because \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk112e070f29b88489;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L1"]
[0.0, "o", "13-L138\u0007ChatRepository.buildAgentConfig\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 leaves \u001b[94mworkspaces\u001b[m as \u001b[94mnull\u001b[m by default, launching the release \u001b[94m.app\u001b[m from\r\n\u001b[6CFinder will configure \u001b[94mlocalharness\u001b[m with \u001b[94m/\u001b[m as its workspace root. Built-in file/search tools (\u001b[94mfind\u001b[m, \u001b[94mgrep_search\u001b[m,\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mlist_dir\u001b[m, \u001b[94mview_file\u001b[m, \u001b[94mwrite_to_file\u001b[m, \u001b[94mfile_edit\u001b[m) remain enabled by default in \u001b[94mCapabilitiesConfig()\u001b[m, meaning the\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6Cagent'\u001b[K\n\n\n\n\u001b[10D\u001b[?2026l"]
